comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-06T18:43:05.367Z",codex-agent,"SDK 2026.11.5 ExtensionCommandReadOutput exposes row_keys only, with no producer continuation callback. Packed npx and bunx both reject a package cursor sent as output-cursor before dispatch (read_output_cursor_invalid). Distinct package cursor and budget flags pass. Open upstream searches for cursor plus extension found 1566, 1360 and 1363 but no exact producer-cursor issue; none filed. Directory backend conformance remains separate from upstream roadmap 1399, 1587 and 1588."
